Criteria
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  [FAIL] 1  the saturation curve is drawn and the increment over the last doubling of trajectory length is below 0.3 kcal/mol on T*S
         measured: +0.0000 kcal/mol (worst trajectory), longest trajectory 5.00 ps  -- SMOKE LENGTH: a trajectory this short has barely begun to rise, so this pass says nothing about production
  [PASS] 2  an independent MASS-WEIGHTED implementation reproduces T*S to within 0.05 kcal/mol (gmx covar -mwa, or MDAnalysis fitted our way)
         measured: gmx: not run (--no-gmx)  MDAnalysis: 3.80e-06
  [FAIL] 4  exactly the rigid-body modes are removed, and they separate cleanly from the first vibrational mode
         measured: 2 removed; smallest separation ratio inf
  [PASS] 5  the blank control (same potential, same basin, different seed) gives a noise floor smaller than the 1.0 kcal/mol target accuracy
         measured: NOT APPLICABLE: one seed per basin (ruling 2026-09-13), no noise floor measured here; see docs/branchB_seeds_and_length.md
  [PASS] 6  S_QH <= S_Schlitter for every trajectory (analytic, so a failure is an implementation error)
         measured: all 3 trajectories
  [PASS] 7  the translational, rotational and electronic terms are identical to the Hessian route's, so only the vibrational term differs
         measured: identical
  [PASS] 8  the symmetry number is read from the declaration, never derived
         measured: sigma = 1 (Cs: no proper rotation axis)
  [FAIL] 9  the number of non-zero eigenvalues equals 3N-6
         measured: 4 of 24 expected  -- SMOKE LENGTH: 5 frames cannot span 24 modes; rank is not measurable here
  [PASS] 10 the per-batch convergence separates unsettled values from missing modes: the mode COUNT must not still be growing
         measured: count stable across prefixes
  [PASS] 11 every trajectory passes the identity assertion (no bias, no constraints, real hydrogen mass, 1 fs, not from CREST or the sampling loop)
         measured: all 3 trajectories

